      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "その日、\n僕はラプルムさんに呼び出され、彼女の元へ向かっていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "3affb3e9514f44e38f4e1dfef9ed4847cf6c70d877882fdaa13087ecd15dac14",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "『スゴいモノ』を見せてくれるらしいけど、\nラプルムさん、今度は一体何の研究を――。",
      "jp_sha256": "2fa26908da1fa33c5c26a71bdd227fb50b7840d4a7569c97ebe04fabc7ee5798",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "‘대단한 것’을 보여 준다는데,\n라플룸 씨, 이번에는 대체 무슨 연구를――.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "a45545c849761dfe2087a0f6bef72f6d76fe198567c2129e5124ce694122863f:000002_8205320978805960217:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "『スゴいモノ』を見せてくれるらしいけど、\nラプルムさん、今度は一体何の研究を――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "d347875783fc3dd6a246c4ceb28766ee415fecceaa811ee653849e4eb6a6a980",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "助手くん！\nよく来てくれたね。待っていたよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "9a029b33f6105423b91c407bcab946f7dcd3310d60274b573ce03d04d5ed1511",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "조수군!\n잘 와 줬어. 기다리고 있었어.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
