      "row_index_0based": 12,
      "serialized_row_index": 12,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "空からぎゅーんとラプルムさんが下りてくる。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ef0dea2cef0cdc2735ac3a621010c11d9001d90c36b615c2a4a44c55feb709fd",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "でも、もう少し遅れてくれてもよかったんだよ？\n新鮮な風と日差しを楽しんでいたところだったからね。",
      "jp_sha256": "66325f5183f34c27c9ef6d84cdebd49980c426bd58a1a131149f520c55de525f",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "하지만 조금 더 늦게 와도 괜찮았어.\n신선한 바람과 햇살을 즐기고 있던 참이었거든.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 42,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "a45545c849761dfe2087a0f6bef72f6d76fe198567c2129e5124ce694122863f:000002_8205320978805960217:g0:r41",
      "row_index_0based": 41,
      "serialized_row_index": 41,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ラプルムムーンチャイルド",
        "Emt4_Enj",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "でも、もう少し遅れてくれてもよかったんだよ？\n新鮮な風と日差しを楽しんでいたところだったからね。",
        "",
        "ch_10414/R18/10414A0_10414_Nml/10414A0_10414_003",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ラプルムムーンチャイルド",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10414/R18/10414A0_10414_Nml/10414A0_10414_003"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "e947b7b380ab7ee168f6f787b8becdbc8c0a3ecbff4eca7752cfc0c50390267f",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ラプルムさんは空中で器用に一回転した。\n狭いフラスコから解き放たれて、自由を楽しんでいるみたいだ。",
      "jp_sha256": "882ec36396daa6d57fcfa03160cf1ea7f3f64f9b3cf6a744d498f5d5764f0b81",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "라플룸 씨는 공중에서 능숙하게 한 바퀴 돌았다.\n좁은 플라스크에서 풀려나 자유를 즐기는 모양이다.",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 45,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "a45545c849761dfe2087a0f6bef72f6d76fe198567c2129e5124ce694122863f:000002_8205320978805960217:g0:r44",
      "row_index_0based": 44,
      "serialized_row_index": 44,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ラプルムさんは空中で器用に一回転した。\n狭いフラスコから解き放たれて、自由を楽しんでいるみたいだ。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
